<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile postpones aluminum sale until Oct 7.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile postpones aluminum sale until Oct 7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center is postponing the 9,800-short-ton aluminum offering until October 7, the agency announced. It was originally slated for September 2.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
